---
import Default from '@astrojs/starlight/components/Banner.astro';
---

<aside class="maintenance-banner" aria-label="Maintenance mode notice">
  <p>
    <strong>OAK is in maintenance mode.</strong>
    I have since started <a href="https://myco.sh">Myco</a>, a new project originally inspired by ideas explored in OAK. Myco goes beyond memory and unlocks true intelligence for your project and your team. Moving over? See the <a href="https://github.com/goondocks-co/myco/blob/main/docs/migrating-from-oak.md">migration guide</a>.
  </p>
</aside>

<Default><slot /></Default>

<style>
  .maintenance-banner {
    background: var(--sl-color-accent-low, #fff8e1);
    color: var(--sl-color-text, inherit);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sl-color-accent, #f0b429);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .maintenance-banner p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 72ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .maintenance-banner a {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent-high, #b45309);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
